#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reverse Engineering"
msgstr "Ingegneria inversa"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ruin a ruin."
msgstr "Distruggi una rovina."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "From Mission Control"
msgstr "Dal centro di controllo missione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We have determined that the best spot to build a <a object|radar>radar</a> "
"on this planet is located on the highest mountain in this region. "
"Unfortunately it is already occupied by a <a object|ruin>ruined radar</a>."
msgstr ""
"Il punto migliore per un <a object|radar>radar</a> è sulla montagna più alta"
" della regione. Purtroppo è occupato da un <a object|ruin>radar in "
"rovina</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build an <a object|labo>autolab</a> and use it to analyze the <a "
"object|tnt>explosive device</a> you acquired, this will allow your <a "
"object|factory>bot factory</a> to replicate the <a object|bottarg>target "
"bot</a> designed by the previous expedition."
msgstr ""
"Costruisci un <a object|labo>laboratorio automatico</a> e analizza l’<a "
"object|tnt>ordigno</a> recuperato. La <a object|factory>fabbrica</a> potrà "
"così riprodurre il <a object|bottarg>robot bersaglio</a> della prima "
"spedizione."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the target bot to dispose of the ruin and build a new radar in its "
"place."
msgstr ""
"Usa il robot bersaglio per distruggere la rovina e costruisci al suo posto "
"un radar nuovo."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<format key><key help/></format> allows you to review these instructions at "
"all times on your personal SatCom <button 63/>."
msgstr ""
"<format key><key help/></format> ti permette di rileggere queste istruzioni "
"in qualsiasi momento sul tuo SatCom personale <button 63/>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a command>Controls</a> and <a cbot>CBOT Language</a>"
msgstr "<a command>Comandi</a> e <a cbot>linguaggio CBOT</a>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/report.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Satellite Report"
msgstr "Rapporto satellitare"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Currently in a geo-stationary orbit of Volcano."
msgstr "Attualmente in orbita geostazionaria attorno a Volcano."

